  "description": "The native payload for Agora's facial expression capture extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_iOS 4.6.2 archive and packaged for .NET for iOS. Tracks facial expression coefficients from the camera, for driving an avatar rather than sending the camera image itself. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.iOS or Net.Agora.Voice.iOS — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraRtcEngineKit's face-info observer in the RTC binding.",
